Subject: [PATCH] DN2026_0003 feat(face): separate Facebook reels publish into
 face_publish.yml

- new workflow face_publish.yml (manual + dispatched by shorts.yml build)
- shorts.yml: dispatch_face job after build; publish job is Threads-only
- run_shorts_publish: SHORTS_PUBLISH_CHANNELS / SHORTS_TARGET_DATE / SHORTS_IGNORE_WINDOW
- backlog re-publish: timing=now, target_date for previous day, duplicate guard unchanged
- verify_repo, docs, tests updated; change points tagged DN2026_0003
